Error: Jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned: `rows` was not moved here, so it cannot replace an owned value
  --> Tests/UI/param_field_assignment_needs_copy_explicit.jet:4:78
    |
  4 |     #Policy(copies: .Explicit) replace: fn(^self, rows: [Int]) { self.rows = rows }
    |                                                                              ^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Copy it explicitly with `rows.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned
